# Vapi Studio best practices (from `@guidify-ai/vapi-studio`)

This file is **managed by** `@guidify-ai/vapi-studio` `postinstall` (`scripts/install-agent-refs.cjs`). Do not replace it with app-specific rules — put those in a separate `.mdc`.

## Before you change conversation behavior

Read the framework guides (prefer the installed package path):

